//~ FLICK-C005 @20:1-22:17
//~ FLICK-C003 @31:1-33:33 `Describe (List Float)` overlaps `Describe (List a)`
//~ FLICK-C007 @37:1-39:26 the context `Describe (List a)` is not smaller than the head `Describe (Wrap a)`
//~ FLICK-C007 @43:1-45:26 type variable `b` of the context `Describe b` is not in the head
//~ FLICK-C008 @47:1-47:26 the superclasses of `First` lead back to it: First -> Second -> First
//~ FLICK-C012 @56:1-58:20 records and tuples have structural `Eq`
//~ FLICK-C001 @65:1-67:23 `Pretty Secret` needs an instance `Show Secret` of its superclass
